on><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.具有良好的专业基础，预计可获得所在高校推免资格；</span></p><p><span>2.光电信息、电子科学与技术、物理、计算机、人工智能、测控技术与仪器、材料科学与工程、电子信息科学与工程、机械等相关专业的本科三年级学生（2026年7月毕业）；</span></p><p><span>3.对我所科研事业具有强烈兴趣，有意向来我所深造学习。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/7uPYV6UT5ng4kqpprLJDVEtS19ibKrRicmhKB4mJt6Zz0yOfPtjk03WiaPBPGf7dWsjg4jQRibb4aoRb7ialEiaAPiaBA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>即日起至8月10日，登录中国科学院大学科教结合协同育人计划网站</span><strong><span>（http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/index.php/zh/）</span></strong><span>，选择右侧“大学生夏令营计划报名”栏目，注册后进入申请系统，承办单位：“西安光学精密机械研究所”，夏令营：“嫦娥奔月夏令营”。按要求如实填写系统中的各项信息并提交。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/7uPYV6UT5ng4kqpprLJDVEtS19ibKrRicmhKB4mJt6Zz0yOfPtjk03WiaPBPGf7dWsjg4jQRibb4aoRb7ialEiaAPiaBA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.报到及提交材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><sectio